@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start the process;
:begin by supplying the requirement;
:and then documenting it;
:If the order is received via fax;
:v1: received method ({fax, mail or phone}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'fax'])
:If the order is received via fax,;
else ([v1 = 'mail or phone'])
:If the order is received via mail or phone;
endif
:input the order into an Excel file;
:Once the Excel list is complete after a week, send it to the student.;
:type the orders into the MS-Access database;
:After typing the orders into the database, ensure that it is completed.;
split
:control the incoming order.;
split again
:At the same time, continue to do the check.;
end split
:v2: evaluate order ({correct, incorrect, less than 5000, more than 5000}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v2 = 'correct'])
:If the order is correct;
:release it;
:Send the Excel list to the student;
case ([v2 = 'incorrect'])
:if the order is incorrect;
:contact the selling agency;
:Contact the selling agency and upon receiving the actual issue, send the order for sign off.;
:v4: issue solved ({no, yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'no'])
:If the issue cannot be solved;
:cancel the order.;
else ([v4 = 'yes'])
:If the issue can be solved;
:release the order.;
:Once the order is received by PPC, they will initiate production.;
:After PPC initiates production, the goods will be produced.;
endif
:v5: evaluate cancellation ({yes, no}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v5 = 'yes'])
:If the order needs to be cancelled;
:the process ends.;
stop
else ([v5 = 'no'])
:If not;
:check the quality of the goods.;
:create and send a quality report to the finance department.;
split
:Release the order via memo;
:and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse.;
:Send the invoice;
:report the achievement to the finance department.;
split again
:At the same time, commission the goods and sign and send the memo.;
:Also, send the goods and ensure that the signed memo is achieved in the logistic department.;
end split
:Finally, archive the memo and close the order.;
:This marks the end of the process.;
stop
endif
case ([v2 = 'less than 5000'])
:If the order is worth less than 5.000 €;
:release it;
case ([v2 = 'more than 5000'])
:If the order is worth more than 5.000 €;
:send it for sign off and continue with the check.;
:Once the order is signed off, contact the client and release the order.;
:release the order.;
endswitch
